docs {
  # Let me check if there's any kind of welcome message or onboarding nudge
  # waiting for me.

  Empty page. Not even a "Welcome to DreamHomes — here's what to do next"
  notification. As a brand-new user the inbox is barren and I have to figure
  out the next step myself. Going to bed — will continue tomorrow.
}
